        "id": "ShenPassive",
        "name": "Ki Barrier",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "After casting a spell, Shen gets a shield. Affecting other champions reduces the cooldown of this effect.",
        "bodyHtml": "Shen gains <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">((47 ~ 120) + ([[si:scalehealth]]13% bonus Health)) Shield</span> for 2.5 seconds after using an Ability. This effect has a 11 second Cooldown, reduced by 4 seconds when one of Shen's Abilities successfully affects an ally or enemy.<br /><br />Shen has a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spirit Blade</span> that his other Abilities use.",
